/// - `generic_method_declaration()`
/// - `generic_constructor_declaration()`
/// - `constructor_declaration()`
/// - `compact_constructor_declaration()`
/// - `field_declaration()`
/// - `interface_body_declaration()`
/// - `interface_member_declaration()`
