/// - `constant_declarator()`
/// - `interface_method_declaration()`
/// - `interface_method_modifier()`
/// - `generic_interface_method_declaration()`
/// - `interface_common_body_declaration()`
/// - `variable_declarators()`
/// - `variable_declarator()`
/// - `variable_declarator_id()`
/// - `variable_initializer()`
/// - `array_initializer()`
/// - `class_type()`
